1
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,620
海莉 你爸爸打电话来了
Haley, your dad's on the phone.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:05,540
他说很紧急
He says it's urgent.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,620
-他跟"外科医生"吗 -我觉得他说的是"鲟鱼"
- He's with a surgeon? - I think he said "sturgeon."

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,460
小卡 你说的是"外科医生"还是"鲟鱼"
Cam, is it "surgeon" or "sturgeon"?

5
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,480
我一回家就要把这该死的牙箍摘掉
I am ripping these stupid braces off the second I get home.

6
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,054
菲尔 别挂 我开免提 好吗
Phil, hold on. I'm gonna put you on speakerphone, okay?

7
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:16,940
安迪要去跟贝丝求婚了
Andy's on his way to propose to Beth!

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,574
我们什么都听不到
We can't hear anything!

9
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,800
把电话扔给我吧
Just toss me the phone.

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:21,290
-别别别 -你说得对
- No! No, no. - No, you're right.

11
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,080
我们都有自己的强项 我擅长送礼
We all have our strengths. I'm a great gift giver.

12
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:23,800
扔过来 小卡
Here, Cam.

13
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:28,040
-老爸 -海莉 安迪要去跟贝丝求婚了
- Dad? - Haley, Andy's on his way to propose to Beth!

14
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:31,080
-那好棒呀 -一点也不棒
- That's very sweet! - It's not sweet!

15
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,480
海莉和安迪彼此相爱 但他们却不知道
Haley and Andy love each other, but they don't know it!

16
00:00:33,493 --> 00:00:34,840
是吗 亲爱的
Is that true, honey?

17
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,780
老爸 你凭什么觉得他爱上我了
Dad, what makes you think he's in love with me?

18
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,700
我看他跟你拥抱道别的样子就知道了
I could tell by the way he hugged you goodbye.

19
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,380
菲尔 你确定吗
Phil, are you sure about this?

20
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:43,320
克莱尔 我看得出男人眼里充满爱的模样
Claire, I think I know the look of love in another man's eyes.

21
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,840
太夸张了 我该给他打电话吗
This is crazy. Should I call him?

22
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:48,040
他的手机关机了 但他说他要去沙滩
His phone's off, but he said he was going to the beach.

23
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,040
我知道他喜欢哪个沙滩
I know what beach he likes.

24
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,880
我以为你就是他喜欢的"沙滩"[妞]
I thought you were the "Beach" he likes.

25
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,540
天啊 他们在那里
Oh, God, there they are.

26
00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,200
我该过去吗 我不该过去
Should I do this? I shouldn't do this.

27
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,200
我过去了
I'm gonna do this.

28
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,246
什...亲爱的 亲爱的 等等 等等
W-- honey, honey, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

29
00:01:04,246 --> 00:01:07,352
你必须百分百确定才行
You got to be really sure of this.

30
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:10,680
你过去拆散他们是为了什么
You're gonna go over there and break them up for what?

31
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:14,800
就为了跟他瞎玩玩 直到下一个人出现吗
To hang out or to date until the next guy comes along?

32
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:18,960
谁知道 但我们难道不该试试是否是真爱吗
Who knows? But shouldn't we get a chance to find out what we are?

33
00:01:18,971 --> 00:01:22,324
我只是说你要看长远一点
I'm just saying look down the road a little.

34
00:01:22,390 --> 00:01:25,160
你才21岁 而那个家伙看样子
You're 21, and that looks like a guy

35
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:27,780
已经准备好安定下来了
who is ready to settle down.

36
00:01:35,614 --> 00:01:36,691
-是啊 -好吧...
- Yeah. - Well, um...

37
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,360
看来他已经替我做好了决定
I guess it's decided for me.

38
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:42,000
我觉得自己真是个傻瓜
I feel like such an idiot.

39
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,420
不 亲爱的 不不不
No. Honey, no, no, no, no, no.

40
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:46,540
你没什么好羞耻的
You have nothing to be ashamed of.

41
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,900
天啊 他们来了 快藏起来
Oh, God! Here they come! Hide!

42
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:48,611
就...
Just --

43
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:07,760
天啊
Oh, God.

44
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,440
小爸看起来好紧绷
Daddy looks tense.

45
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,100
他只是要付账单了
He's just paying bills.

46
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,300
还好吗 亲爱的
Is everything okay, honey?

47
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,520
你走过来的呀
Oh, you walked over here.

48
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:17,380
我还以为你上哪儿都打优步呢
I just thought you Uber-ed everywhere.

49
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:19,240
-好吧 -好吧 我得呼吸一下
- Okay. - Okay, I got to breathe.

50
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,500
这还是免费的吧
That's still free, isn't it?

51
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:21,900
米奇尔 没那么糟啦
Mitchell, it's not that bad.

52
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:24,020
真的吗 因为我好几周没工作了
Really? Because I haven't worked in weeks.

53
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,240
前途渺茫
I have no prospects.

54
00:02:25,420 --> 00:02:27,100
我们靠着一个体育老师的工资生活
We're living off of a gym teacher's salary,

55
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:29,160
然后我还不知道哪根筋搭错了
And -- and somehow I let you

56
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,860
被你说服买下了楼上的房子
talk me into buying the apartment upstairs.

57
00:02:31,460 --> 00:02:33,060
这是什么情况 我们变穷人了吗
What's going on? Are we poor?

58
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:35,280
不 但你小爸在找工作的期间
No, while other daddy looks for a job,

59
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,600
我决定去当
I'm gonna be taking on some work

60
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,980
暑期驾驶教练
as a summertime driver's ed teacher.

61
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,380
那能挣多少钱
How much can that pay?

62
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:40,480
聚沙成塔
Every little bit helps.

63
00:02:40,540 --> 00:02:42,200
而且 米奇尔 在你意识过来前
And besides, Mitchell, before you know it,

64
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,800
你很快就会回到一间无聊的办公室
you're gonna be back in a stuffy office

65
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,200
跟一群无聊的律师在一起
with some stuffy lawyers,

66
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:48,460
后悔自己没有好好利用这段时间
wishing you had taken advantage of this time.

67
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:48,940
我说得对吗
Am I right?

68
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,920
听起来倒很像我
Well, that doesn't not sound like me.

69
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:53,000
没错 所以你为什么不利用这次机会
Exactly, so why don't you take this chance...

70
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,480
做点好玩的事情 找个爱好呢
...to do something fun, find a hobby?

71
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:58,420
每次我们去美术馆 你总会说
You know, every time we go to a gallery, you always say,

72
00:02:58,620 --> 00:02:59,960
"这么蠢的东西我也会画啊"
"I could paint something that stupid."

73
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,480
那就证明一下吧
Well, prove it.

74
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,820
其实还真是 我一直很想画画
You know what? I have. I've always wanted to paint.

75
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:06,060
我们楼上的屋子也肯定很多人会抢着租
And the place upstairs is gonna be a rental gold mine --

76
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:09,180
只等我们刷上漆 配上家具 修好电路
Once we paint it, we furnish it, we fix the electric,

77
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:09,960
重新铺好水管
redo the plumbing,

78
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,980
搞清楚那块棕色斑点为何还在变大就行
and figure out why that brown spot won't stop growing.

79
00:03:13,260 --> 00:03:14,100
它还长大了吗
It's growing?

80
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,540
你们俩浪费了一整天缝花被子吗
Did you two really just waste your entire day quilting?

81
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:20,920
我们玩得很开心啊 是吧 亲爱的
We had a wonderful time, didn't we, sweetie?

82
00:03:21,380 --> 00:03:22,680
我没有再哭了
I'm not crying anymore.

83
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:25,020
为了让她停止想安迪
To help get her mind off of Andy,

84
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,560
海莉和我在做一件花被子
Haley and I have been making a quilt

85
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,940
用的是她的旧衣服...
out of all her old clothes...

86
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:30,640
和一些我不想让菲尔再穿的东西
and some stuff I need Phil to stop wearing.

87
00:03:30,933 --> 00:03:33,837
酷 那块方形跟我的袋鼠牌帽子花纹一样
Oh, cool. That square is the same pattern as my kangol hat.

88
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:37,100
你们知道外面有多美吗
Can you believe how gorgeous it is outside?

89
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,940
现在里面也很美
And now it's gorgeous inside.

90
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,200
因为你在里面 我表达清楚吗
Because you're inside. Was that clear?

91
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,420
你想来考考我元素周期表吗
Hey, do you want to go quiz me on the periodic table?

92
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:44,520
氧钾
Oxygen potassium.

93
00:03:45,460 --> 00:03:47,520
他用这两个元素说"OK"
He used the elements to say "Okay."

94
00:03:48,860 --> 00:03:50,440
看完之后特"开心"啊
Well, that was fun for me.

95
00:03:51,460 --> 00:03:53,000
妈 我们可以现在喝酒吗
Mom, can we drink now?

96
00:03:53,220 --> 00:03:54,260
亲爱的 现在是午餐时间
Honey, it's lunchtime.

97
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,100
那就是说行
That's a "Yes."

98
00:03:58,540 --> 00:04:00,680
我为什么觉得你很享受
Why do I feel like you're enjoying this?

99
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,300
-什么 -伤心的海莉又需要她妈妈了
- What? - Sad Haley needs her mommy again.

100
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,580
真荒唐
That's ridiculous.

101
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:06,260
我只是在帮她化心碎为力量
I'm just helping her channel her broken heart

102
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:07,420
改去做一些积极的事
into something more positive.

103
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,380
拜托 那是自艾滋病被子之后
Please, that's the saddest blanket

104
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:10,340
最悲哀的一块花被子了
since the AIDS quilt.

105
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:12,940
海莉沉溺于自怜之中 而你以此为生
Haley's wallowing in self-pity, and you're feeding off of it.

106
00:04:13,060 --> 00:04:14,380
你不知道自己在说什么
You don't know what you're talking about.

107
00:04:14,380 --> 00:04:16,560
妈妈 我要去午睡了
Mom, I'm just gonna go take a nap.

108
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,140
亲爱的 你想让我抱着你
Oh, sweetheart, do you want me to snuggle with you

109
00:04:18,140 --> 00:04:18,940
陪你睡着吗
till you fall asleep?

110
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:21,240
够了 失恋派对结束了
Okay, that's it. Pity party's over.

111
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:24,120
该来点邓菲家的娱乐了 我们去看电影
Time for some Dunphy fun. We are going to the movies.

112
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:26,020
你上次洗澡是什么时候
When was the last time you showered?

113
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,160
今天是几号
What day is it?

114
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,140
我们等你
We will wait.

115
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:32,480
我知道你不能告诉我 但那个B·威利斯攀爬架
I know you can't tell me, but that B. Willis jungle gym --

116
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:33,900
是演员布鲁斯·威利斯对吗
That's Bruce Willis, right?

117
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:35,200
他的孩子们也在这上学吗
His kid goes here?

118
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:38,300
本校以保密而著称
Well, we do pride ourselves on privacy here at Davenport,

119
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:41,740
但你的"灵异第六感"很准哦[布鲁斯的电影]
but, uh, you may have a "Sixth Sense" about this.

120
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,640
太棒了
I'll be damned.

121
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,060
他看起来像是那种
He looks like the kind of guy

122
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:45,300
你想跟他来杯啤酒的人
you want to have a beer with, you know?

123
00:04:45,340 --> 00:04:47,800
我们给每四个小孩配备一个老师
We have one educator for every four children --

124
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:48,840
我有个问题
I have a question.

125
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:51,400
我跟你们这里的一个毕业生是高中同学
Uh, I attend high school with one of your graduates,

126
00:04:51,410 --> 00:04:52,990
他叫西欧多尔·德卡斯
a Theodore Durkas.

127
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,460
是你把他教成了禽兽 还是他从小如此
Did you turn him into a monster, or was he always like that?

128
00:04:55,471 --> 00:04:57,269
我还真记得泰迪·德卡斯
I actually remember Teddy Durkas.

129
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:58,420
他是个可爱的小男孩
He was a lovely boy.

130
00:04:58,540 --> 00:04:59,500
下次他把我的乳头掐紫时
I'll give him your regards

131
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:01,480
我会替你问候他的
next time he's making one of my nurples purple.

132
00:05:03,555 --> 00:05:05,541
乔 你做了什么
Ay, Joe, what did you do?!

133
00:05:05,541 --> 00:05:06,780
不是他的错
Oh, it's not his fault.

134
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:08,860
这些柜子是之前一个家长捐的
These cubbies were donated by a former parent

135
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:10,360
他觉得自己是个木匠
who fancied himself a carpenter.

136
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:13,360
我不能说是谁 但是这很讽刺
I can't say who, but it is ironic

137
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:16,080
他不懂怎么用铁锤 我们也"不能碰这个"了
that he couldn't use a hammer, and now we "Can't touch this."

138
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,840
你一直说你不能说 然后你又说出来了
You keep saying you can't say, and then you say.

139
00:05:18,060 --> 00:05:19,720
难得能跟成年人说话太幸福了嘛
It's just nice to talk to adults.

140
00:05:20,248 --> 00:05:22,820
我们愿意了 你想要乔吗 他归你们了
We're sold. You want Joe? He's yours.

141
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:25,320
你们真是太聪明了 提前预定明年
It was very smart of you to get a jump on next year.

142
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:27,795
明年 今年呢
Next year? What -- what about this year?

143
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:30,500
我们这里注册起码排到隔年
We enroll at least a year out.

144
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:32,440
就算是提早 等待名单也超长
And even then, there's a significant waiting list.

145
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,740
-你开玩笑吧 -抱歉 普里契特先生
- You're kidding. - I'm sorry, Mr. Pritchett.

146
00:05:35,891 --> 00:05:38,546
你可以去学习谷仓看看啊
You could try the Learnin' Barn.

147
00:05:38,613 --> 00:05:40,870
听起来不错
Ah, yes. That sounds very nice.

148
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:42,740
学习谷仓听起来不错吗
The Learnin' Barn sounds nice?

149
00:05:42,740 --> 00:05:44,800
是啊 在我的村子里 只有富裕的孩子
Yes, in my village, only the richest kids

150
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,760
才能在谷仓里学习
were allowed to learn inside the barn.

151
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,240
希望你们喜欢恐龙
Hope you guys like dinosaurs.

152
00:05:50,700 --> 00:05:53,840
我给我们买了《涉外大饭店2》的票
I got us tickets to "The second best exotic Marigold hotel."

153
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,180
我知道你在开玩笑
I know you're kidding,

154
00:05:55,180 --> 00:05:57,600
但是我觉得第一部超感人
but I found the first one incredibly moving.

155
00:05:58,860 --> 00:06:01,540
我从没意识到商场里有多少人牵着手
I never realized how many people hold hands in malls.

156
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:03,200
现在同性恋合法了
And now that gays are legal or whatever,

157
00:06:03,200 --> 00:06:04,660
基本上所有人都牵着手
it's basically everyone.

158
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,880
亲爱的 我来牵着你的手 来吧
Honey, I'll hold your hand. Come here.

159
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,380
那是迪兰吗
Is that Dylan?

160
00:06:09,495 --> 00:06:11,681
不 那绝对不是迪兰
No. No, that's -- that's definitely not Dylan.

161
00:06:11,681 --> 00:06:12,850
迪兰
Dylan!

162
00:06:13,932 --> 00:06:15,480
好啊 邓菲一家
Hello, Dunphy family!

163
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,440
真巧啊
What the what?

164
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:18,140
你好吗 孩子
How you doing, buddy?

165
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:21,000
生活是一辆过山车 但我够高了 可以乘坐
Life's a roller coaster, but I'm tall enough to ride.

166
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:21,880
同意
True dat.

167
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:23,920
海莉 你看起来一如既往的美丽
Haley, you look as yummy as ever.

168
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,800
谢谢 你在忙什么呢
Thanks. What's going on?

169
00:06:26,809 --> 00:06:28,152
我现在在设计T恤
So, I'm designing t-shirts now,

170
00:06:28,152 --> 00:06:30,100
想说服商店卖我的T恤
and I'm trying to get the stores to sell them.

171
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,440
我穿的就是呢
I'm wearing one.

172
00:06:31,576 --> 00:06:32,660
-撒谎吗 -是生活
- "Lie"? - "Live."

173
00:06:32,660 --> 00:06:33,580
V领也代表一个字母
The neck is the "V."

174
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,520
跨时代创意啊
Game changer.

175
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:37,100
是啊 我还有很多很棒的带V的词语
Yeah, and I've got all these great "V" words.

176
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:38,800
爱情 鸽子
"Love," "Dove" --

177
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:39,680
-走开 -州长
- Leave. - ..."Governor."

178
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:42,320
这主意真棒
That is such a cool idea.

179
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:44,100
真高兴见到你
It's so good to see you.

180
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,560
你想抽空喝杯咖啡吗
Do you want to get some coffee sometime?

181
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:48,040
我现在就没事啊
I'm not doing anything right now.

182
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,280
看电影呢
Movie.

183
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:52,220
不错 但不是所有带V的词都有用 邓太太
Nice try, but not all "V" words work, Mrs. D.

184
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,700
你俩玩得开心哦
Have fun, you two.

185
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:58,220
你迪什么迪啊
"Dylan!"

186
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:06,780
米奇尔 你知道我们女儿在吃蕃茄酱三明治吗
Mitchell, are you aware our daughter's eating a ketchup sandwich?

187
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,820
真好 她找到吃的了
Good, she found something.

188
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,900
你今天没去买菜啊
So, you didn't go grocery shopping today.

189
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:12,300
我会去的 但我要先去做瑜伽
I am gonna go, but after yoga.

190
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:13,360
你应该跟我一起来
You should come with me,

191
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,955
因为你看起来真的很紧绷
'cause you seem really tense.

192
00:07:14,966 --> 00:07:17,180
他们有那种五分钟的班
well, maybe they have a five-minute class

193
00:07:17,180 --> 00:07:19,460
能挤进我橄榄球夏令营和驾校之间吗
I could sneak in between football camp and driver's ed?

194
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:23,220
不 我很为你和你的葡萄柚骄傲
No, I'm very proud of you and your grapefruit.

195
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:23,980
这是克莱斯勒大厦
Chrysler building.

196
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:25,540
米奇尔远比我想象中
Mitchell really embraced

197
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:26,920
更欣然地接受了
this whole "take a little break" thing

198
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,120
短暂休假这件事
far more than I expected.

199
00:07:28,180 --> 00:07:30,080
可是这么多年来都是他在赚钱养家
But for years, he supported both of us

200
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,480
让我自由发展爱好
while I pursued my passions --

201
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:35,440
比如摄影 嘻哈舞 猎狐
photography, hip-hop dancing, fox hunting.

202
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:38,340
所以我没资格催他去找工作
So I couldn't be the one to tell him to get a job.

203
00:07:39,380 --> 00:07:40,980
不过也许别人可以
But maybe somebody else could.

204
00:07:45,163 --> 00:07:47,649
查理 我是卡梅伦
Charlie? It's -- it's, uh, Cameron.

205
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:49,180
我丈夫米奇尔曾为您工作过
My husband Mitchell used to work for you.

206
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:51,800
我记得你
I remember you.

207
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,440
真是惊喜啊
Yeah, what a nice surprise.

208
00:07:53,660 --> 00:07:55,200
就是 真疯狂
I know! Crazy!

209
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:58,200
就跟我告诉米奇尔是鸡的那狐狸一样疯狂
Crazy like that fox I told Mitchell was chicken.

210
00:07:59,541 --> 00:08:01,872
很明显吧 我跟踪了查理
Was it clear? I-I stalked Charlie.

211
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:02,740
我不敢相信
I can't believe it.

212
00:08:02,740 --> 00:08:05,780
米奇尔和我昨天晚上还在谈论你
Mitchell and I were just talking about you last night.

213
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:06,460
你好吗
How are you?

214
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:08,660
我不想拿我的问题来打扰你
Well, I don't want to burden you with my problems.

215
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:11,120
不过我的游艇好像不够大了
I think I've outgrown my boat.

216
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,000
-米奇尔好吗 -他很好
- How is Mitchell? - He's fine.

217
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,260
实际上 他最近收到好几份工作邀请
Actually, he's fielding a few job offers right now,

218
00:08:16,460 --> 00:08:17,640
但是遇到点小麻烦
and he's running into problems

219
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:19,920
因为他一直拿所有人跟你比
because he keeps comparing everyone to you.

220
00:08:20,640 --> 00:08:22,100
有时候我都觉得
Sometimes I think the only thing

221
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:23,720
唯一能让他好受的办法
that's gonna make him feel better

222
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:26,080
是您再提供一份工作给他
is if you offered him another job.

223
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:27,980
什么 我愿意
What the hell? I'll do it.

224
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,280
-真的吗 -我要买一艘新游艇
- Really? - Yeah, I'm getting a new boat.

225
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,460
我会找米奇尔说的
And I will talk to Mitchell.

226
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:34,500
我怀念那张三美元
I miss that $3 bill.

227
00:08:36,580 --> 00:08:38,300
你们安排好了分手时间
You scheduled your breakup?

228
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:41,000
对 劳动节 我回学校的日子
Yes, Labor Day. That's when I leave for school.

229
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,800
86%的长距离恋爱最终失败
86% of long-distance relationships end in failure.

230
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:45,760
这是唯一合理的行为
It's the only logical course of action.

231
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:48,860
这是我听过最不浪漫的事
That is the least romantic thing I've ever heard.

232
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:50,180
继续在一起啊
Stay together.

233
00:08:50,343 --> 00:08:51,948
错了 应该分手
Wrong. Break up.

234
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:54,280
大学是世界上最诱人的糖果店
College is the sexiest candy store in the world.

235
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,300
你可不想闭紧着嘴巴进去
You don't want to show up with your jaws wired shut.

236
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:58,540
不 就拿我跟海莉的经验来说
No, take it from Haley and me.

237
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:00,760
分开再在一起
It's hard to be apart and then together

238
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,660
再分开再在一起
and then apart and then together

239
00:09:02,660 --> 00:09:05,220
再分开 被海军给拒了
and then apart and then turned down by the marines

240
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:06,180
再在一起 真的好难
and then together.

241
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:09,760
不敢相信那个傻瓜又回到我们的生活中
I can't believe we've got that dodo back in our lives.

242
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:11,120
至少海莉开心了
At least Haley's happy.

243
00:09:11,196 --> 00:09:13,403
亲爱的 你至少把那T恤给脱了吧
Honey, could you at least take that T-shirt off?

244
00:09:13,403 --> 00:09:16,317
熟食店里的人很喜欢 他们可得意了
They loved it at the deli. They were kvelling.

245
00:09:16,818 --> 00:09:17,720
大家好
Hey-oh!

246
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,780
-安迪 -你好
- Andy! - Hi.

247
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,920
抱歉打扰了你们 我只是想把这些给你
Sorry to interrupt. I just want to get these to you.

248
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:23,240
-这是跟贝伍德的合约 -太棒了
- Here is the closing on Baywood. - Awesome.

249
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:26,070
这是强森的报价 只要签名就好
And this is the Johnsons' offer, all set for signatures.

250
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,240
你已经破茧成蝶了 哥们
You've done a real mitzvah, buddy.

251
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,700
希望还不错
I hope that's good.

252
00:09:32,591 --> 00:09:35,440
好久没见过你了
I -- it's been awhile since I've seen you.

253
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,460
我多加了好多班
Yeah, I've been putting a lot of hours in,

254
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,920
为婚礼多赚些钱
trying to earn extra money for this wedding.

255
00:09:39,260 --> 00:09:41,680
你好 我是迪兰 海莉的男朋友
Hola. I'm Dylan, Haley's boyfriend.

256
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:46,560
我是安迪 我不知道你们已经复合了
I'm Andy. I didn't realize you two are back together.

257
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:47,480
是啊
Oh, yeah.

258
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:49,140
我们就像磁铁一样
We're like magnets...

259
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:52,180
偶尔分开去约一下别的磁铁
that sometimes take a break to date other magnets.

260
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,580
我们在一起过
What happened was we were together,

261
00:09:54,580 --> 00:09:56,320
然后分开了
and then we were apart.

262
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:58,620
感谢您今天花时间见我们
Thank you so much for making time for us today.

263
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:00,340
很抱歉花了这么长时间
I'm sorry it took so long,

264
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:03,160
教职员们都放暑假去了
but the faculty kind of scatters for the summer.

265
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:06,780
我开着我的卡车去缅因州种了豆子
I drove my van to Maine and planted beans.

266
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:08,580
让我猜猜 然后杀死了一个巨人
Let me guess -- and killed a giant.

267
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:12,120
-鸡 -这是怎么... 乔
- Chicken! - What the -- Joe!

268
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,500
乔 回来
Joe, come back here.

269
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,560
没关系 小鸡们不会伤到他的
It's okay. The chickens won't hurt him.

270
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,680
它们习惯了小孩子
They're used to the kids.

271
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,740
小鸡也是这里的一部分吗
Chickens are part of this?

272
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:20,520
我们喜欢尽量利用山里的一切
We like to utilize the setting here in the hills,

273
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:23,500
让自然成为体验的一部分
make nature a part of the experience.

274
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:27,180
我们偶尔会看到老鼠 浣熊或者小松鼠
We sometimes see mice or raccoons or little squirrels.

275
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,740
你知道还有专门捉这些的陷阱吧
You know they got traps for those kind of things.

276
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:31,840
我喜欢这里 乔能够在新鲜空气里奔跑
Ay, I love it. Joe gets to run around in the fresh air.

277
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,780
艾瑞卡 我需要你
Erica, I need you!

278
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,020
抱歉 失陪一下
I'm sorry. Excuse me.

279
00:10:38,220 --> 00:10:39,180
我们要走了
We're out of here.

280
00:10:39,192 --> 00:10:41,340
她很奇怪 让孩子们
She's a loon, letting kids call her "Erica"

281
00:10:41,340 --> 00:10:42,140
像牌友一样直呼她艾瑞卡
like they're poker buddies.

282
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:44,140
这么晚我们去不了别的地方了
We're too late for anywhere else.

283
00:10:44,140 --> 00:10:46,340
如果布鲁斯·威利斯能靠
If Bruce Willis can jungle-gym his way

284
00:10:46,340 --> 00:10:49,040
捐攀爬架进高大上学校 那我也能...
into that fancy school, then I can...

285
00:10:49,457 --> 00:10:50,640
我不知道 我能靠柜子进去
I don't know -- I can cubbie my way in.

286
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:52,520
他们不喜欢现在的柜子 我给他们做新的
They hate their cubbies? I'll make them new ones.

287
00:10:52,940 --> 00:10:54,160
小柜子不就是小版衣柜嘛
Cubbies are nothing but little closets.

288
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:57,060
看看乔 他喜欢这里
Ay, but look at Joe. He loves it.

289
00:10:57,060 --> 00:10:58,480
他正追鸡呢
He's chasing after the chickens.

290
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:01,100
他还逮到一只
He even caught one.

291
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:04,220
不 不
No! No!

292
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:05,480
别呀 乔 快放开
No, Joe! Let go!

293
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,880
我们很乐意付那只鸡的钱
We will be very happy to pay for that chicken.

294
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:13,080
米奇尔 米奇尔
Mitchell, Mitchell!

295
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:15,640
看看我一不小心还十分巧合得碰见了谁
Look who I bumped into accidentally by chance.

296
00:11:15,660 --> 00:11:16,360
你好啊 陌生人
Hey, stranger.

297
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:17,500
查理
Charlie!

298
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,300
不知道你还会画画
I didn't know you painted.

299
00:11:19,460 --> 00:11:20,360
其实我也不知道
I didn't, either.

300
00:11:20,780 --> 00:11:22,700
刚开始只是为了消忧解闷
It sort of started as a therapeutic thing,

301
00:11:22,700 --> 00:11:24,520
但后来就爱上它了
But then I just really fell for it.

302
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:26,280
我一直都想画画
I always wanted to paint.

303
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,200
我靠
Damn it!

304
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:28,720
我为什么不画画
Why am I not painting?

305
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:31,040
你管理公司很忙嘛
Well, you're so busy running your company.

306
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:33,240
要不多雇点人 这样你就有空了
Maybe if you hired more people, you'd have more time.

307
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:35,880
我睡了那么多演员模特
I sleep with so many actresses and models

308
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:38,320
她们喜欢有飞机 游艇和度假别墅的男人
who are into guys with jets and boats and ski houses,

309
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,620
但我一直在想 睡喜欢艺术家的
But I always wondered, wouldn't it be more satisfying

310
00:11:40,620 --> 00:11:43,560
模特和演员肯定更来劲
To sleep with actresses and models who are into artists?

311
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:46,220
对了 你刚在说你被工作搞得喘不过气
Anyway, you were saying how overwhelmed you were at work.

312
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:47,700
这幅画才美得让我不能呼吸
I'm overwhelmed by this work.

313
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,860
你都怎么决定画什么的呢
How do you decide what to paint?

314
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:51,860
我脑子里有些画面
You know, I just see these images in my head,

315
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:54,240
比如说 我想看的东西 想去的地方
Uh, things I want to see, places I want to go,

316
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,820
还剩下多少颜料
how much paint I have left.

317
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:58,800
有些时候就跟着感觉走
sometimes I just tap into my emotions,

318
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:01,060
看看最后是什么效果
and I see where that takes me.

319
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:04,280
你都想不到整个人能有多满足
And -- you cannot imagine the sense of contentment.

320
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:06,260
想想工作一整天
Imagine how much more satisfying it would be

321
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:07,340
会有多爽吧
after a good day's work.

322
00:12:07,340 --> 00:12:08,620
我来这里
You know, I came here to talk you

323
00:12:08,620 --> 00:12:09,800
本是想让你回公司工作
into coming back to the company,

324
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:13,080
但你是我见过最波澜不惊的小伙
But you're the most at-peace son of a bitch I've ever met,

325
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:15,300
我可是请大喇嘛主持过泳池派对的人
And I hired the Dalai Lama for a pool party.

326
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:19,200
谢谢 长官
Thank you, commander.

327
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,840
出城的时候我会顺便送到办公室
I will drop these at the office on the way out of town.

328
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,420
还有什么事吗
So, unless there's something else?

329
00:12:23,420 --> 00:12:25,580
你就是事 克莱尔赏他个杯子蛋糕
You're something else. Claire, get this man a cupcake.

330
00:12:25,580 --> 00:12:27,640
不用了 邓菲夫人
No, thank you, Mrs. Dunphy.

331
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,620
我马上就要穿礼服了
I've got to fit into a wedding tux pretty soon.

332
00:12:29,860 --> 00:12:31,720
好吧 你出发吧 骑车愉快
All right, get out of here. Happy motoring.

333
00:12:32,746 --> 00:12:34,537
-再见 安迪 -再见
- Bye, Andy. - See you.

334
00:12:34,799 --> 00:12:36,240
他要去哪
Where's he off to?

335
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:38,380
犹他州 去那一个月准备婚礼
Utah for a month to plan his wedding.

336
00:12:38,525 --> 00:12:41,760
我好后悔 安迪很棒
I'm kicking myself. Andy is great.

337
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:43,560
要不是我多嘴
And if I hadn't opened my big, fat mouth,

338
00:12:43,820 --> 00:12:46,180
也许海莉现在就和他在一起了 而不是迪兰
Haley might be with him right now instead of with Dylan.

339
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:50,740
-你想什么呢 -没什么
- What? - Nothing.

340
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:51,160
克莱尔
Claire?

341
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:53,598
我在想 假如安迪知道
Oh, I was just wondering what would happen

342
00:12:53,609 --> 00:12:57,600
海莉差点... 会怎么样
if Andy were to find out that Haley almost --

343
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:59,640
我们不能插手
No. We are not meddling like that.

344
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:00,900
不 我们当然不会了
No, we're not. Of course we're not.

345
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:04,720
但是你插手了啊
But you meddled when you called Haley

346
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:06,372
你打电话告诉海莉安迪喜欢她
and told her that Andy liked her.

347
00:13:06,372 --> 00:13:07,940
这跟告诉安迪
That's a far cry from telling Andy

348
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:09,140
海莉喜欢他
Haley was in love with him

349
00:13:09,140 --> 00:13:11,340
还曾跑到海滩想阻止过求婚差远了
and raced to the beach to stop his proposal.

350
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,000
是卢克吗
Luke?

351
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:16,340
不是
Nope.

352
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:19,300
我不小心拿了你的笔
I accidentally took your pen.

353
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:21,480
我不想在规划自己婚礼的时候
And I didn't want to go plan my wedding

354
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,160
心里有这么大个包袱
with something so big weighing on my mind.

355
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,640
安迪 真抱歉
Andy, I am really sorry.

356
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,840
我不是故意让你听见的
I didn't mean for you to hear that.

357
00:13:25,850 --> 00:13:28,990
别担心 没事
Do not worry. No big dip!

358
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,480
真的
Really?

359
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:30,280
真的
Sure!

360
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:32,920
这其实挺好笑的
It's actually kind of funny, you know?

361
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:35,144
生活多疯狂啊
'Cause how crazy is life?

362
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:36,380
我一直在想 该向贝丝求婚吗
I was all, "Should I propose to Beth?

363
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:37,300
但我对其他人还有感觉
I have feelings for someone else."

364
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,300
我还想着海莉
Meantime, I was talking about Haley.

365
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:41,120
海莉很明显对我有感觉 我却不知道
Haley apparently had feelings for me, and I had no clue!

366
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:44,360
这难道不搞笑吗
How could you not laugh at something like that, right?

367
00:13:49,392 --> 00:13:50,260
真好吃
So good.

368
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:52,120
好了 国庆节快乐
All right. Mmm. Happy Fourth.

369
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:54,080
我啥事没有
I am so fine.

370
00:14:00,364 --> 00:14:01,746
-大伙好 -大家好
- Hey - Hello Hello

371
00:14:01,746 --> 00:14:03,086
这东西放哪
Where do I put this?

372
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:04,420
放台子上就行 谢谢
Anywhere on the counter is great, thanks.

373
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:05,100
老爸
Hi, dad.

374
00:14:06,347 --> 00:14:08,900
你胸口上是啥字
What's, uh, "E-olve" Mean?

375
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:10,460
是进化
Oh, no. It says "Evolve."

376
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:13,200
这是迪兰的设计 领口代替V字
It's one of Dylan's designs. The neck is the "V."

377
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:15,640
-这词里有两个V啊 -但人没有两个脖子啊
- There's two V's. - There can't be two necks.

378
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:18,440
-那为啥这么设计 -求别让我替他辩护
- Then why even do it? - Don't make me defend this, dad.

379
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,540
我就想做老好人
I am just trying to be supportive.

380
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,420
别理他 他这么暴躁
Ignore him. He's just grumpy

381
00:14:21,420 --> 00:14:23,220
是因为乔明天要上学了
because Joe starts school tomorrow.

382
00:14:23,220 --> 00:14:24,880
孩子们第一次离开家的时候
Well, that's hard when they leave the nest

383
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:25,800
的确挺让人难受的
for the first time.

384
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,860
我才不在乎那件事
I don't care about that.

385
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:30,760
我只是想靠东西不会掉出来的小柜子
All I wanted was to bribe my way into that fancy school

386
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:33,249
来疏通进那家高大上的学校
by making cubbies stuff didn't fall out of.

387
00:14:37,640 --> 00:14:40,160
我们不能说太多 案子还在等结果
We can't say more. Litigation is pending.

388
00:14:42,180 --> 00:14:44,900
好了 谁想吃我拿手的鸡肉沙拉
All right, who's ready for my famous chicken salad?

389
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,180
谢谢
Thank you!

390
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:48,618
-锡纸记得还我们 -好的
- We need the foil back. - Right.

391
00:14:49,549 --> 00:14:51,400
你的耳朵怎么了 梵高
What happened to your ear, Van Gogh?

392
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:53,020
我在外面画向日葵的时候
I was painting sunflowers outside,

393
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:54,180
被蜜蜂叮了
and I got stung by a bee.

394
00:14:54,340 --> 00:14:55,900
我觉得那是对我绘画水平的赞赏
You know, I take it as a compliment.

395
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:57,380
来自蜜蜂界的赞赏吗
From the bee community?

396
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,420
天啊 克莱尔 那是我的画
Oh, my goodness, Claire. That's one of mine.

397
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:01,300
-是的 -那幅画挂在那里太美了
- Yes, it is. - Oh, that looks so good there.

398
00:15:01,300 --> 00:15:03,980
是吧 所有颜色我都喜欢 让我心旷神怡
Right? I just love all the colors. It makes me feel so happy.

399
00:15:04,180 --> 00:15:04,580
是啊
Yeah.

400
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:06,000
我管它叫"移民者的掠夺"
I call it "Rape of the immigrant."

401
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:08,240
布朗尼蛋糕好像忘在车里了
I think we left the brownies in the car.

402
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:10,340
-我去拿 -去吧 伙计
- I'll get those. - Well, way to go, pal.

403
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,500
好了 你们到底是怎么回事
Okay, what is wrong with you people?

404
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:16,772
我都快死了 拼命干着两份工作
I am dying here, trying to hold down two jobs

405
00:15:16,772 --> 00:15:18,395
而你们却任由一个曾经意气风发的人
while you enable a once-proud man

406
00:15:18,395 --> 00:15:21,204
浪费才能做些毫无意义的傻事
who is clearly having a talent-free breakdown.

407
00:15:21,204 --> 00:15:23,203
你知道为什么他让你想到梵高吗
You know why he reminds you of Van Gogh?

408
00:15:23,223 --> 00:15:24,440
因为他不赚半毛钱
It's because he's earning nothing,

409
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,780
而且他就要疯了
and he's losing his mind!

410
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:29,620
各位 猜谁回来了
Hey, everybody! Guess who's back?!

411
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,180
谁 谁回来了
Who? Who is back?

412
00:15:31,180 --> 00:15:31,460
安迪
Andy.

413
00:15:31,900 --> 00:15:34,140
安迪 抱歉 一下子没认出你来
Andy! Sorry, it took me a second.

414
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:37,474
没关系 我知道 我的发型有些不一样
No, I know. I -- I'm parting my hair a little differently.

415
00:15:37,474 --> 00:15:39,660
-是啊 -这是我的新变化之一
- Yeah. - That's one thing that's new about me.

416
00:15:39,660 --> 00:15:41,220
贝丝喜欢我这样
So, Beth likes it this way.

417
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:42,920
-我喜欢 挺不错的 -挺好的
- I-I love it, looks great. - It looks great.

418
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:44,240
谢谢你们
Thank you.

419
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:46,380
米奇尔叔叔
Hi, Uncle Mitchell.

420
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,120
宝贝 怎么了
Honey, what's wrong?

421
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:52,017
没什么 我刚送走桑杰
Nothing. I-I-I just said goodbye to Sanjay.

422
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:52,960
我们分手了
We broke up.

423
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:53,700
不
No.

424
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:55,148
没关系 这很好
No, it's -- it's -- it's great.

425
00:15:55,148 --> 00:15:57,640
我们 我们都想没有负担的回到学校
We're -- we're both going to school unencumbered

426
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,920
专心于学业
and ready to focus.

427
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:00,340
这才是明智之举
It's the smart thing to do.

428
00:16:00,820 --> 00:16:02,540
我们都十分满意这个做法
We both feel really good about it.

429
00:16:02,760 --> 00:16:03,960
可你看起来并不好
You don't look like you feel good.

430
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:06,350
是啊 他比我想象得要伤心
Well, yeah, he was -- he was sadder than I imagined,

431
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,740
所以我必须为了他而坚强起来
so I'm being strong for the both of us,

432
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:09,980
这正是他欣赏我的地方
which he said he admires.

433
00:16:10,840 --> 00:16:11,640
我想是吧
I think.

434
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:13,260
听着他那些约翰传奇的歌
It was hard to hear him

435
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:14,860
还有抽噎声 我听不太清他说的话
with all the John Legend and the sobbing.

436
00:16:17,180 --> 00:16:17,940
你知道吗
You know what?

437
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,860
我最近也经历了一段很难熬的日子
I recently went through a very hard time,

438
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:22,020
而我发现了一种非常有助于
and I found something that really helped me

439
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:22,820
排遣消极情绪的方法
navigate my feelings.

440
00:16:22,820 --> 00:16:24,380
-我不想画画 -绘画
- I don't want to paint. - Painting.

441
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:29,620
天啊 是不是
Oh, my God, right?

442
00:16:29,980 --> 00:16:31,400
我要吓疯了
I am freaking out.

443
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,540
你觉得他是因为听到我们的谈话才那样的吗
You don't think that's because of what he heard us say, do you?

444
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:35,720
不 很多人订婚以后都会发胖
No, lots of people gain weight during their engagement.

445
00:16:35,780 --> 00:16:36,660
-你就是 -我当时怀孕了
- You did. - I was pregnant.

446
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:37,880
我在努力想理由呢 克莱尔
I'm trying, Claire.

447
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:39,260
我不想相信我们是害他成这样的元凶
I don't want to believe we're responsible.

448
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,320
他当然是因为我们才这样的
Of course we're responsible.

449
00:16:40,820 --> 00:16:42,620
很明显 安迪自从发现海莉曾试图
Clearly, Andy has been stuffing his face

450
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:44,860
阻止他求婚 就开始暴饮暴食
ever since he found out that Haley almost stopped his proposal.

451
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:45,740
什么
What?

452
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:48,320
我们以后真应该在车库里说话了
We have got to start talking in the garage.

453
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,500
迪兰 你能为我做个盘子吗
Dylan, could you make me a plate?

454
00:16:50,660 --> 00:16:52,340
如果我都能用胡萝卜做出一杆烟枪
If I can make a bong out of a carrot,

455
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:53,900
那我肯定能为你做个盘子
I think I can make you a plate.

456
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:56,560
你告诉安迪我曾试图阻止他求婚吗
You told Andy I tried to stop his proposal?

457
00:16:56,660 --> 00:16:57,510
不是故意的
Not on purpose.

458
00:16:58,020 --> 00:16:59,760
在他去犹他州前夕 你父亲和我
Before he left for Utah, your father and I

459
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:02,680
私下里在讨论 如果被他发现
were privately discussing how bad it would be

460
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,800
情况会有多糟糕 结果被安迪听见了
if he found out, and Andy overheard us.

461
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:05,660
他当时说什么了
What did he say?

462
00:17:05,860 --> 00:17:06,760
他说他没事
He said he was fine.

463
00:17:06,847 --> 00:17:10,869
可是... 现在我们不太肯定了
But...now we're not so sure.

464
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:14,560
天啊
Oh, my God.

465
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:15,900
天啊 那是安迪吗
Oh, my God, that's Andy?

466
00:17:16,681 --> 00:17:18,580
你们觉得他是因为我才胖成那样的吗
You think he got fat 'cause of me?

467
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:20,000
也许吧 是的
Possibly. Yes.

468
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,600
我该去跟他谈谈吗
Should I talk to him about it?

469
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:23,600
宝贝 那得由你自己来决定
Honey, that has to be your decision.

470
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:25,800
我们不想再干涉你的感情生活了
We are through meddling in your love life.

471
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:27,400
是的 不过我要说 他依然有婚约在身
Yeah. Though I will say he's still very much engaged.

472
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,160
如果是我呢 我会想知道
Whereas, I would want to know if he got fat

473
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,340
他发胖是否因为依然爱着我
because he was still in love with me.

474
00:17:30,620 --> 00:17:31,740
现在我们走了
And now we're out.

475
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:34,520
你看 是不是舒服多了
See, don't you feel better?

476
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:35,580
没有
No.

477
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,540
别纠结于光线
Don't stress out about light

478
00:17:37,540 --> 00:17:39,280
景致 还有颜色
and perspective and -- and color.

479
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:42,300
知道吗 就随心所欲地画出想表达的东西
You know, just let your painting be what it wants to be.

480
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:44,154
-怎么样 -让我看看
- How's this? - Here, let's see.

481
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,900
搞什么鬼 你怎么画得这么好啊
What the hell? Why are you so good?

482
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:49,240
我也不知道 我大部分事情都很擅长
I don't know. I'm just good at most things.

483
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,680
通常我也是啊
So am I, usually.

484
00:17:51,740 --> 00:17:53,760
等等 桑杰也是这样
Wait a second. So is Sanjay.

485
00:17:53,948 --> 00:17:56,576
我得在他走之前赶紧去找他
I-I-I-I have to get to him before he leaves.

486
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:02,240
-你真的画得越来越好了 -你还是进屋去吧
- You're really getting better. - Maybe you should go inside.

487
00:18:04,116 --> 00:18:06,875
乔 乔 乔 赶紧给我下来
Joe, Joe, Joe, Joe, get down from there!

488
00:18:06,875 --> 00:18:09,188
-你会受伤的 -发生什么事了
- You're gonna get hurt. - What happened?

489
00:18:09,242 --> 00:18:11,260
这就是他不该去你那家公立幼儿园的原因
This is why he shouldn't go to your commune.

490
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:13,320
他会摔下来 那些嬉皮士根本注意不到
He'll fall, those hippies won't notice,

491
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:14,880
他会被鸡给生吞活剥了的
And he'll be eaten alive by chickens.

492
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:16,060
我想我们已经确定过
I think we have established

493
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:18,300
在鸡面前 他完全可以保护好自己的
That he can take care of himself around a chicken.

494
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:22,260
你老是忘记乔很强悍 他也遗传自我
You keep forgetting that Joe is tough. He's part me.

495
00:18:22,829 --> 00:18:24,938
你该担心的是你那个儿子
That's the son that you should be worrying about.

496
00:18:28,220 --> 00:18:30,420
我曾以为可以不用再管那个儿子了
I really thought I was done with that one.

497
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:34,980
你还好吗
How's it going?

498
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:38,055
我受了点小伤 以及其他一些问题
I got a splinter... and a few other issues.

499
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:39,980
你知道这是什么情况吧
You know what's happening here, don't you?

500
00:18:39,980 --> 00:18:41,827
你遭遇中年危机了
You're having a mid-life crisis.

501
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:42,520
天啊
Oh, my god.

502
00:18:43,020 --> 00:18:44,940
有些人通过开快车 找小三解决
Some guys, it's fast cars and women.

503
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:46,620
我 是打高尔夫
Me, it was golf.

504
00:18:46,665 --> 00:18:49,348
你 则成了基佬中的战斗基
You, it's just a little gayer.

505
00:18:49,348 --> 00:18:51,620
我认识大约10个高尔夫球打得比你好的拉拉
I know like 10 lesbians who could out-golf you.

506
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:54,380
重点是 如果你的那根弦绷得太紧
The point is when you're wound as tight as we are,

507
00:18:54,600 --> 00:18:55,960
是会断的
You're bound to snap.

508
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:59,392
是啊 太长时间以来我都十分拼命地工作
Yeah, I-I've just been working so hard for so long.

509
00:18:59,392 --> 00:19:00,275
然后我突然停下来了
And now that I've stopped,

510
00:19:00,275 --> 00:19:03,169
我 我就难以再重新开始了
I'm -- I'm having a hard time starting again.

511
00:19:03,180 --> 00:19:04,280
我懂的
Oh, I get it.

512
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:06,760
我有一年夏天休假6周专门去打高尔夫
I took six weeks off one summer just to play golf.

513
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:09,180
有一天 在俱乐部联赛中
And one day, during the big club tournament,

514
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:11,220
我把一根7号铁球棒挥出了界外
I hooked a seven-iron out of bounds.

515
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:14,020
我气坏了 把球棒绑在一棵树上
I got so pissed that I wrapped the club around a tree

516
00:19:14,020 --> 00:19:17,000
然后把一台高尔夫车从桥上开进湖里
And drove the golf cart off the little bridge into the lake.

517
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:20,360
我永远无法忘记那位驻场选手对我说的话
I'll never forget what the club pro said to me.

518
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:22,880
"普里契特先生 你不是个好的高尔夫球手
"Mr. Pritchett, you're not a very good golfer.

519
00:19:23,300 --> 00:19:24,560
回去干你的正经工作吧"
Go back to your day job."

520
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:27,620
我知道我不是个好画家 爸
I know I'm not a good painter, dad.

521
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,620
我 我只是希望在回去工作前
I -- I was just hoping to feel a little bit better

522
00:19:30,620 --> 00:19:32,260
先让自己感觉好一些
Before going back to work.

523
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:35,020
你只有回去工作了 才会感觉好一些
You're not gonna feel better until you go back to work.

524
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:36,980
米奇尔 你是个出色的律师
Mitchell, you're a great lawyer.

525
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,640
继续去当律师吧
Go do that.

526
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:39,840
还有去把头发剪剪
And get a haircut.

527
00:19:44,357 --> 00:19:46,868
听着 我听说你发现了
So, listen, um, I heard that you found out

528
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:48,400
我那天其实去了海滩
That I was at the beach that day.

529
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:51,440
是啊
Yeah.

530
00:19:52,620 --> 00:19:54,680
我之前不知道你对我是那种感觉
I didn't know you felt that way about me.

531
00:19:54,970 --> 00:19:55,950
如果那时候知道就好了
Would have been nice to know.

532
00:19:55,950 --> 00:19:58,320
那时如果知道你对我也有感觉就好了
Well, it would have been nice to know you had feelings for me.

533
00:19:58,320 --> 00:20:00,000
那样 很多事情都会变得无比美好
A lot of things would have been nice.

534
00:20:00,860 --> 00:20:02,640
你现在对我有感觉吗
Do you have feelings for me now?

535
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,840
海莉 我已经订婚了
Haley, I'm engaged.

536
00:20:06,820 --> 00:20:07,920
你没有正面回答我
That's not an answer.

537
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:12,480
你为什么选择现在来谈这事啊
Why are you picking now to talk about all this?

538
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:14,960
因为我担心你这样
Because I'm worried about all this.

539
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,820
什么啊 我的体重吗
What? My weight?

540
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:19,600
拜托 我分分钟就能减肥成功
Please. This will drop off in a second.

541
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:22,180
安迪 你觉不觉得有这么一种可能
Andy, don't you think that there is a chance

542
00:20:22,180 --> 00:20:23,380
就是你现在暴饮暴食
That you have been eating

543
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:25,060
是因为你后悔跟贝丝订婚了
Because you regret getting engaged to Beth?

544
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:28,080
我为什么要后悔啊 贝丝超赞的
Why would I do that? Beth is amazing.

545
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:30,980
贝丝是个试图点燃我头发的神经病
Beth is a psycho who tried to light my hair on fire.

546
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:33,580
然而 迪兰现在正在后院
Meanwhile, Dylan is in the backyard

547
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:35,480
试图用小棍棒做个盘子呢
Trying to make a plate out of sticks.

548
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:37,920
至少他知道自己想要什么 然后就努力去追求了
Well, at least he knows what he wants and goes for it.

549
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:39,880
那我觉得我们没在一起真是好事呢
Then I guess it's a good thing that we didn't get together.

550
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:41,180
真是我做过的最明智的决定
Best decision I ever made!

551
00:20:41,180 --> 00:20:42,576
我也是
Samesies!

552
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,500
我不打算说谎 菲尔
I'm not gonna lie, Phil.

553
00:20:48,700 --> 00:20:49,900
我或许不得不插手了
I might need to get back into that.

554
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:56,840
桑杰
Sanjay!

555
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,320
天啊 我无法承受再次道别
Oh, god. I can't say goodbye again.

556
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:00,140
我们不必道别的
We don't have to.

557
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:02,458
我们这个决定是根据统计数据而做出的
We're basing this decision on a statistic.

558
00:21:02,458 --> 00:21:05,500
86%的异地恋都以失败告终 对吧
86% of long-distance relationships end in failure, correct?

559
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:06,120
当然对了
Of course "correct."

560
00:21:06,140 --> 00:21:07,220
你向来都不会错误引用数据的
You'd never misquote a statistic.

561
00:21:07,380 --> 00:21:08,340
你也不会的
And neither would you.

562
00:21:08,340 --> 00:21:11,700
我们有哪方面是在落后的那86%的群体中啊
When have we ever been in the bottom 86% percentile of anything?

563
00:21:11,940 --> 00:21:12,980
从没有 那样我情愿去死
Never. I'd kill myself.

564
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:14,520
我们属于那顶尖的1%
We're in the top 1%.

565
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:17,800
没错 我只用了一个下午就学会了画画
Exactly. I learned how to paint in an afternoon.

566
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:19,200
昨晚 我开发了一个App
Last night, I developed an app

567
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,300
可以从大学里远端喂我的鱼
to feed my fish from college.

568
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:24,140
如果说有人能异地恋成功 那就是你和我了
If anyone can make this work, it's you and me.

569
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:25,260
天啊 我好爱数字
God, I love numbers.

570
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:26,800
我也好爱数字
I love numbers too.
